# Component Specifications

## BookCard Component

### File Location
[src/components/BookCard.vue](mdc:src/components/BookCard.vue)

### Purpose
Display sutra information on the bookshelf with progress indicator.

### Props

```javascript
{
  sutra: {
    type: Object,
    required: true,
    validator: (value) => {
      return value.id && value.title && value.cover
    }
  },
  progress: {
    type: Number,
    default: 0,
    validator: (value) => value >= 0 && value <= 100
  }
}
```

### Events

```javascript
// Emits when card is clicked
@click
```

### Slots

```vue
<template>
  <div class="book-card" @click="handleClick">
    <!-- Cover -->
    <div class="book-cover">
      <slot name="cover">
        {{ sutra.cover }}
      </slot>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Title -->
    <div class="book-title">
      <slot name="title">
        {{ sutra.title }}
      </slot>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Progress -->
    <div class="book-progress" v-if="progress > 0">
      <slot name="progress" :progress="progress">
        <div class="progress-bar">
          <div class="progress-fill" :style="{ width: progress + '%' }"></div>
        </div>
        <span class="progress-text">{{ progress }}%</span>
      </slot>
    </div>
  </div>
</template>
```

### Responsive Behavior

- **Mobile (< 600px)**: Full width card, compact layout
- **Tablet (600-1024px)**: 2-column grid, medium card size
- **Desktop (> 1024px)**: 3-4 column grid, large card size

