## ThemeToggle Component

### File Location
[src/components/ThemeToggle.vue](mdc:src/components/ThemeToggle.vue)

### Purpose
Toggle between light and dark themes.

### Props

```javascript
{
  modelValue: {
    type: String,
    default: 'light',
    validator: (value) => ['light', 'dark'].includes(value)
  }
}
```

### Events

```javascript
@update:modelValue
```

### Methods

```javascript
function toggleTheme() {
  const newTheme = props.modelValue === 'light' ? 'dark' : 'light'
  emit('update:modelValue', newTheme)
  
  // Apply theme to root element
  if (newTheme === 'dark') {
    document.documentElement.classList.add('dark-mode')
  } else {
    document.documentElement.classList.remove('dark-mode')
  }
  
  // Save to localStorage
  localStorage.setItem('theme', newTheme)
}
```

### Template

```vue
<template>
  <div class="theme-toggle" @click="toggleTheme">
    <van-icon :name="themeIcon" size="24" />
    <span class="theme-label">{{ themeLabel }}</span>
  </div>
</template>
```

### State

```javascript
const themeIcon = computed(() => {
  return props.modelValue === 'light' ? 'sun-o' : 'moon-o'
})

const themeLabel = computed(() => {
  return props.modelValue === 'light' ? '日间模式' : '夜间模式'
})
```

### Styling

```scss
.theme-toggle {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--space-2);
  padding: var(--space-3);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background var(--transition-fast);
  
  &:hover {
    background: var(--divider-color);
  }
  
  .theme-label {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
}
```

